wer_delta","text":" [ICD-DOCK-01].\n"}},{"dt":39,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":"**Public precedent**\nA forum thread says"}},{"dt":36,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":" a failed-open thruster valve"}},{"dt":39,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":" is isolated by closing its upstream latch/is"}},{"dt":33,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":"olation safety valve, permanently disabling that thr"}},{"dt":37,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":"uster [WEB-1].\nA D"}},{"dt":34,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":"LR-hosted document says autonomous fault"}},{"dt":36,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":" detection designs automatically switch"}},{"dt":37,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":" off the active propulsion branch when a"}},{"dt":38,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":" stuck-open thruster is detected [WEB"}},{"dt":47,"event":{"type":"answer_delta","text":"-2]."}},{"dt":136,"event":{"type":"usage","usage":{"label":"answer","role":"answer","model":"muse-spark-1.3","effort":"high","ms":54633,"promptTokens":5352,"completionTokens":7841,"reasoningTokens":7287,"costUsd":0.04001425}}},{"dt":0,"event":{"type":"thinking","label":"answer","model":"muse-spark-1.3","effort":"high","text":"Generating a structured operator report with four bold headings and bracketed citations using only provided briefing and tool results."}},{"dt":3,"event":{"type":"answer","markdown":"**Diagnosis**\nThruster 3 on M-11 stuck open after uncommanded rate +0.003 °/s [FE-0736] [TM-M11-RATE], with close commands at t=70 s and t=95 s showing no response [OPS-VALVE-07] [FE-0737].\nValve LV-1107 was accepted slow 340 ms vs 200 ms spec [NCR-0388], confirmed 340 ms in 50-pulse hot-fire [TR-1244], on Gen-1 module with 4 RCS pods [BLD-M11] with no upstream isolation [OPS-VALVE-07].\nDock latch load is 969.4 N at t=120 s vs 800 N nominal [TM-M11-LATCH], rising 84.19 per min to cross 4500 N upper limit at t=897 in 777 s [TM-M11-LATCH], where ring may shear [ICD-DOCK-01] [FE-0738].\n**What the cameras show**\nCAM-2 shows white plume with bright orange base from thruster pod on top outer edge extending about module-width outward [CAM-2], with no holes, scorch or discoloration near pod and no stress on radiator latches [CAM-2].\nCAM-2 notes +X centre grapple fixture appears occupied by white-and-yellow object [CAM-2].\nSAM 3.1 on CAM-3 gives SEG-1 on grapple fixture distance 0.02 from grapple [SEG-1] [CAM-3], 1.30 m from stuck thruster [SEG-1].\n**Decision**\nMIGRATE_WORKLOADS M-11 to M-04, M-05, M-10, auto: deadline none before AOS t=3120 s, TM-LAT-UTL 75.7 % ≤ 95 % [TM-LAT-UTL].\nDEORBIT_MODULE M-11 grasp SEG-1, auto: deadline t=780 s before AOS t=3120 s for 4500 N at t≈900 s [TM-M11-LATCH] [SEG-1] [ICD-DOCK-01].\n**Public precedent**\nA forum thread says a failed-open thruster valve is isolated by closing its upstream latch/isolation safety valve, permanently disabling that thruster [WEB-1].\nA DLR-hosted document says autonomous fault detection designs automatically switch off the active propulsion branch when a stuck-open thruster is detected [WEB-2].","citations":[{"type":"event","id":"FE-0736","label":"Uncommanded body rate +0.003 °/s: RCS thruster 3 valve open"},{"type":"telemetry","id":"TM-M11-RATE","label":"TM-M11-RATE (FDIR channel)"},{"type":"record","id":"OPS-VALVE-07","label":"Thruster 3 valve close command: no response"},{"type":"event","id":"FE-0737","label":"Valve close command sent, no response (OPS-VALVE-07)"},{"type":"record","id":"NCR-0388","label":"Thruster 3 latch valve accepted with slow actuation"},{"type":"record","id":"TR-1244","label":"M-11 RCS hot-fire acceptance"},{"type":"record","id":"BLD-M11","label":"M-11 build traveler"},{"type":"telemetry","id":"TM-M11-LATCH","label":"TM-M11-LATCH (FDIR channel)"},{"type":"record","id":"ICD-DOCK-01","label":"mentioned by get_telemetry"},{"type":"event","id":"FE-0738","label":"Latch load 964 N and rising; projects 4500 N limit (ICD-DOCK-01) at t≈900"},{"type":"camera","id":"CAM-2","label":"Damage site close-up, 4 m"},{"type":"camera","id":"CAM-3","label":"Grapple fixture + latch A, 4 m"},{"type":"segment","id":"SEG-1","label":"grapple fixture (matched as \"circle\") in CAM-3"},{"type":"telemetry","id":"TM-LAT-UTL","label":"Lattice compute utilisation"},{"type":"web","id":"WEB-1","label":"forum.nasaspaceflight.com","url":"https://forum.nasaspaceflight.com/index.php?topic=51346.680"},{"type":"web","id":"WEB-2","label":"Microsoft Word - Stockholm_2012-TDX-article.doc","url":"https://elib.dlr.de/id/eprint/76296/contents"}],"unknownIds":[],"numbers":{"checked":15,"unsupported":[]}}},{"dt":0,"event":{"type":"done","totals":{"promptTokens":45565,"completionTokens":15099,"costUsd":0.128424,"toolCalls":7,"ms":110146}}}]